# samples/points.txt is deliberately NOT ignored. It used to be,
# which meant every fresh clone got an office that printed nothing
# and exited 0 -- the demo for the framework's headline feature,
# broken for every new user. The file is deterministic (seed=42,
# see samples/make_points.py), so committing it is committing a
# fixture, not a build artifact.
build/
snapshots/

!samples/make_points.py
